  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ce1a382eaf569f942bd90e68195dab6f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NewGameIntroSequence
  playWhenTestingInEditor: 1
  storyLines:
  - "T\u1EEB thu\u1EDF xa x\u01B0a, v\xF9ng \u0111\u1EA5t Fantasia l\xE0 n\u01A1i
    con ng\u01B0\u1EDDi v\xE0 mu\xF4n lo\xE0i th\xFA c\xF9ng chung s\u1ED1ng."
  - "M\u1ED7i lo\xE0i th\xFA mang trong m\xECnh s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh c\u1EE7a t\u1EF1
    nhi\xEAn:\nL\u1EEDa, N\u01B0\u1EDBc, C\u1ECF, \u0110i\u1EC7n, Bay, B\xF3ng T\u1ED1i,
    R\u1ED3ng... v\xE0 c\u1EA3 nh\u1EEFng s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh ch\u01B0a ai bi\u1EBFt
    t\u1EDBi."
  - "Nh\u1EEFng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\u1EE7 d\u0169ng c\u1EA3m \u0111\u1EC3 k\u1EBFt
    giao v\u1EDBi ch\xFAng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c g\u1ECDi l\xE0 Nh\xE0 Hu\u1EA5n Luy\u1EC7n."
  - "Nh\u01B0ng g\u1EA7n \u0111\xE2y, nh\u1EEFng v\u1EBFt n\u1EE9t m\xE0u t\xEDm
    k\u1EF3 l\u1EA1 b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u xu\u1EA5t hi\u1EC7n kh\u1EAFp n\u01A1i..."
  - "Th\xFA hoang tr\u1EDF n\xEAn hung d\u1EEF, v\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ta th\xEC th\u1EA7m
    v\u1EC1 m\u1ED9t c\xE1i t\xEAn \u0111\xE3 ng\u1EE7 y\xEAn h\xE0ng tr\u0103m n\u0103m:\nDetale."
  - "T\u1EA1i m\u1ED9t ng\xF4i l\xE0ng nh\u1ECF y\xEAn b\xECnh, m\u1ED9t h\xE0nh
    tr\xECnh m\u1EDBi s\u1EAFp b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u."
  - "H\xE0nh tr\xECnh c\u1EE7a {name}."
